{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__49_.gif?t=1745254866\" /><br><br>CursedSword is a Sokoban-style sliding puzzle game where your attacks grow stronger with every move! Bash through monsters, traps, and obstacles to crack snappy puzzles, battle bosses in turn-based showdowns, discover hidden treasures, and unlock game-changing power-ups. Join the hero on a quest to break the curse and bring justice to his hometown!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/cs_game.gif?t=1745254866\" /><br><br>Unlock power-ups on your journey to the Countess Castle. Stuck on a tricky puzzle? These are your secret weapon. Use them strategically to overcome obstacles and break through when you're stuck.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/cs_shop.gif?t=1745254866\" /><br><br>Face challenging turn-based boss battles and test your skills against the Countess's fiercest champions.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200230/extras/cs_boss.gif?t=1745254866\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Embark on a journey through a spooky island ruled by danger and evil monsters.<br></li><li>Hundreds of deadly puzzles.<br></li><li>Retro inspired 2D top-down pixel graphics.<br></li><li>A snappy grid-based movement that lets you plan every move!<br></li><li>Eight mysterious areas of the Haunted Island full of monsters and traps!<br></li><li>Challenging turn-based boss fights protecting the way to the Countess's Castle.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Deep Pockets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2200230/1b15ee4954668625178d24ff2dadc52cea7f0b9a.jpg"},{"name":